      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, into the spawned Ingest agent child process (and similarly for the Query agent). \n\nThe key detail is that the injection happens **immediately before the child process starts**, not before that. The Hub\u0027s own process environment never holds the key; instead, a local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the child process\u0027s environment. This ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables.",
